  partName: Valve Cover (2)
  description: The Valve Cover (2) is a small, compact component positioned at the
    middle-center-front of the engine, made of plastic-cone-black material. Its primary
    function is to protect the valve train from debris and contaminants, ensuring
    smooth engine operation. Notably, the valve cover's small size and compact shape
    allow for easy installation and maintenance, reducing downtime and increasing
    overall engine efficiency.
